        <item>
            <title>0.1.1</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 19:10:49 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://straylight.banast.as</link>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>The menu bar item is 10 points narrower: with a trace, the verdict mark sits beside the latency instead of in its own column</li>
  <li>The popover reopens in about 25 ms instead of 75: it's kept for a minute after closing</li>
  <li>The popover opens at its full height instead of growing on its first frame</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
